+/* M5Stack Core's ILI9341 TFT, on VSPI (SPI3) CS0, D/C on GPIO27 -- this
+ * chip-generic machine models no board wiring at all otherwise (there is
+ * no per-board file the way most QEMU SoCs get one), so this is this
+ * fork's own downstream addition rather than anything upstream
